["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasOutput", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Build, DefinedProcess or Action element generates each `to` Element as an output.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
